<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="hxE2f3ff27gz0BeTUMvX">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1030" dy="622" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="gM_MQEXaM2VPmeeXQ9fv-4" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Temporal : : https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Temporal&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Usage :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Temporal.PlainDate.from(&quot;2026-12-25&quot;) - date&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Temporal.PlainTime.from(&quot;9:40&quot;) - time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Temporal.Instant.from() -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;represented as the number of nanoseconds since the Unix epoch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Temporal.ZoneDateTime.from()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Temporal.Duration.from({hours : 7})&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="760" x="10" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gM_MQEXaM2VPmeeXQ9fv-5" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;ECMAScript : : Explicity Reource Management&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&#39;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Using&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&#39; keyword + Symbol.dispose protocol to release resources&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;With using keyword &amp;gt; if a variable goes out of scope because of the end of the block, early return, javascript lets go of the resources → automatically calls Symbol.dispose.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="760" x="20" y="360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gM_MQEXaM2VPmeeXQ9fv-6" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Joint Iteration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Iterator.zip([names, ages, cities])&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Iterates multiple literals in parallel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Can iterate using&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;mode -&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;Iterator.zip([names, ages, cities] , {mode})&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;similar to python - pandas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;modes :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 1rem 0px 2rem; font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(24, 25, 27);&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&quot;shortest&quot;&lt;/code&gt; (default): The resulting iterator stops when one input iterable is exhausted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&quot;longest&quot;&lt;/code&gt;: The resulting iterator stops when all input iterables are exhausted. Missing values from shorter iterables are filled according to the &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;&quot;&gt;padding&lt;/code&gt; option.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(0, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;&quot;&gt;&quot;strict&quot;&lt;/code&gt;: A &lt;code style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;JetBrains Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.125em 0.25em;&quot;&gt;TypeError&lt;/code&gt; is thrown if not all input iterables finish at the same time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Inter, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;padding :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Inter, sans-serif&quot;&gt;If undefined or absent, missing values from shorter iterables are filled with undefined (which is equivalent to passing an empty iterable).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="429" width="760" x="20" y="531" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
